<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ fiscal update to be tabled on May 21 - Peters.</title>
<headline>NZ fiscal update to be tabled on May 21 - Peters.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Treasurer Winston Peters said the 1996/97 supplementary estimates, together with the current-year fiscal update, would be tabled in Parliament at 2 p.m. on May 21, not on May 22 as perviously advised.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
